        "category": "ancestry",
        "description": {
            "value": "<p>Your olfactory system has been enhanced with a more powerful and precise sense of smell. You gain imprecise scent with a range of 30 feet. This means you can use your sense of smell to determine a creature's location. The GM will usually double the range if you're downwind from the creature or halve the range if you're upwind.</p>\n<p>In addition, you gain a +2 circumstance bonus to Perception checks to [[/act seek]] a creature or object within the range of your scent.</p>"
